output.big_idea:
Every piano listing in the category says "88 клавиш", and every peer demo is a brand clip with no buyer question. Muzzone's own brand-only demos sit at about 390 views against a channel median of 2 300 (L006). The platform idea «Одна фраза» turns the store's physical stock into the answer. The same short phrase is played on every in-stock digital piano: the same preset, the same volume, the phone 20–30 cm from the speaker. Prices, and the gap between them, appear inside the story and never as a slide. We say plainly what the product card does not tell you.

Device (the distinctive asset): frame 1 is always top-down, with hands already mid-phrase and sound from the first frame. The caption template is «[разница] — слышно?». The same signature phrase is reused in every episode. Around this hero series sit three things:
- a save-driven utility series, «Перед оплатой»;
- an honest parent-question series, «Вопрос родителя»;
- a December gift-moment series.

The conversion layer underneath has one WhatsApp code per video, a pinned «Как заказать пианино» video, WA Status for existing contacts, and a reactivated YouTube search line that uses the same footage under plain model-name titles (L002/L004).

This is a type S campaign that back-plans from 31.12:
- explore 12–25 Oct;
- focus 26 Oct–22 Nov;
- scale 23 Nov–20 Dec;
- conversion push 21–31 Dec.

The SMP is PROVISIONAL. The insights have no customer-chat evidence yet (INS1–INS4 all score E=1), so per C7 the SMP is confirmed or replaced from the weeks 1–2 data. It is not locked on taste.

offer.proposal:
No offer at launch. Content leads. Only published, standing terms are referenced, quoted exactly:
- minimum 12-month warranty;
- Casio 2-year warranty, service in Almaty;
- 14-day return of unused goods, with two-way delivery withheld;
- free RK delivery over 100 000 ₸;
- 3-working-day pickup reserve, extendable on request.

Site markdowns on piano SKUs may be mentioned only as published, with no deadline and no «Финальная распродажа» wording until Q2 is answered.

Three non-discount options are drafted for the owner. They are not used until the owner gives an explicit «да», stored as a client fact.

(1) Try-in-store («Приходите сыграть на любых моделях в наличии — по слову из ролика покажем рядом те, что вам интересны»). This needs confirming in week 0 anyway, because the BLIND-01 and STAKES-11 CTAs promise «сыграть самим».

(2) December gift reserve. This formalises the published «можно попросить продлить» into exact terms, e.g. «оплатили — заберёте до [дата]». It is the only legitimate December urgency, and it is required before GIFT-05 can say «до 31-го».

(3) Instalments, trade-in or rental. These would resolve INS4 («а если бросит?»). We only flag them and claim nothing unless the owner chooses to offer one.

Trigger: if the 2026-11-22 checkpoint misses ≥10 coded inquiries after the R7 funnel fixes, option (1) or (2) is proposed formally with exact terms and dates.

Separately, we will not use or promote the site's «компенсация доставки за честный отзыв или видео». It is likely an incentivised review under platform rules, and we recommend removing it.

